    "b-25-approval-nodes-an-answer-names-the-occu-24": {
      "id": "b-25-approval-nodes-an-answer-names-the-occu-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "An answer names the occurrence it was meant for, so an answer to an earlier pause\nof the same run is refused. Answering through the CLI without "
        },
        {
          "insert": "--json",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " continues\nthe run in that process; otherwise "
        },
        {
          "insert": "archon serve",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " or "
        },
        {
          "insert": "archon workflow wake",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "\ncontinues it. Attention waits are not supported in container-isolated workflows."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-25-approval-nodes-continuing-after-an-answ-25": {
      "id": "b-25-approval-nodes-continuing-after-an-answ-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Continuing after an answer picks the run up where it paused. Nodes that completed\nreplay their results, and a node that failed before the pause replays its failure\ninstead of running again, because the run had already moved past it. On the first\nanswer, if the question the wait would ask now differs from the one that was answered,\nthe wait discards the answer and asks again. Its notice names the changed dependencies\nwhen the engine can identify them; otherwise it gives a generic notice that the\nquestion changed. After one re-ask, the next answer is accepted even if the question\nchanges again. See "
        },
        {
          "insert": "attention waits",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "doc",
              "path": "docs/10-system-design/10-reference/35-workflow-language.md",
              "section": "attention-waits",
              "label": "attention waits"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-25-approval-nodes-reading-the-answer-26": {
      "id": "b-25-approval-nodes-reading-the-answer-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Reading the answer"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-25-approval-nodes-downstream-nodes-read-th-27": {
      "id": "b-25-approval-nodes-downstream-nodes-read-th-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Downstream nodes read the answer as "
